    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:</i>&nbsp;<i><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Knights_of_the_Old_Republic_Campaign_Guide\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide\">Star Wars Saga Edition Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide</a></i> </p><p><b>Manufactured By:</b> <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/The_Krath\" title=\"The Krath\">The Krath</a> (Organization) </p><p><b>Applicable To:</b> Any Armor, Any Melee Slashing or Piercing Weapon </p><p>Items created by <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/The_Krath\" title=\"The Krath\">The Krath</a> typically have a cruel and dangerous twist. </p><p><b>Weapons:</b> If an attack roll with a Krath Manufacture Weapon equals or exceeds the target's <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Fortitude_Defense\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Fortitude Defense\">Fortitude Defense</a> as well as its <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Reflex_Defense\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Reflex Defense\">Reflex Defense</a>, the target takes 1d4 damage at the beginning of it's next turn. </p><p><b>Armors:</b> Krath Manufacture Armors and Shields provide <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Damage_Reduction\" title=\"Damage Reduction\">Damage Reduction</a> 2 against Energy damage. </p><p><b>Special:</b> Krath Manufacture Weapons and Armor hold the taint of <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/The_Dark_Side\" title=\"The Dark Side\">The Dark Side</a> within them, and any character wielding a Krath Weapon or wearing Krath Armor treat their <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Dark_Side_Score\" title=\"Dark Side Score\">Dark Side Score</a> as one higher than it actually is for purposes of being targeted by effects that only affect targets with a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Dark_Side_Score\" title=\"Dark Side Score\">Dark Side Score</a>. </p>",
